00:13:26,867 --> 00:13:29,497
I don't have anyone else I can turn to.

2220
00:13:30,247 --> 00:13:31,907
What can you see there?

2221
00:13:32,537 --> 00:13:33,617
I have to run.

2222
00:13:39,587 --> 00:13:41,667
Light rail trains are crossing...

2223
00:13:45,217 --> 00:13:46,507
Beyond this point...

2224
00:13:46,887 --> 00:13:48,677
You're planning to leave through a plugvent?

2225
00:13:48,677 --> 00:13:49,847
l don't care anymore.

2226
00:13:49,847 --> 00:13:53,017
If I'm really done for,

2227
00:13:53,017 --> 00:13:54,017
I might as well go outside-

2228
00:13:54,017 --> 00:13:55,727
What awaits you outside is a world of death.

2229
00:13:56,557 --> 00:14:00,107
It doesn't seem like I can become a model citizen.

2230
00:14:00,107 --> 00:14:01,027
Vincent!

2231
00:14:01,027 --> 00:14:04,027
I'm glad I could hear your voice one last time.

2232
00:14:04,317 --> 00:14:06,107
I'll go to the plugvent as well.

2233
00:14:06,107 --> 00:14:07,527
Wait until I get there.

2234
00:14:07,527 --> 00:14:08,617
Vincent!

2235
00:14:17,537 --> 00:14:18,667
Dammit!

2236
00:14:34,937 --> 00:14:36,387
What the...

2237
00:14:36,387 --> 00:14:37,397
hell?

2238
00:14:45,447 --> 00:14:46,567
Damn!

2239
00:14:48,697 --> 00:14:50,617
Let's find another route.

2240
00:14:51,327 --> 00:14:52,867
You don't need this?

2241
00:14:52,867 --> 00:14:54,447
It's heavy.

2242
00:15:01,917 --> 00:15:03,627
Wait, wait!

2243
00:15:14,177 --> 00:15:15,597
The Security Bureau, huh.

2244
00:15:40,287 --> 00:15:42,167
This place isn't any good either.

2245
00:15:55,217 --> 00:15:56,847
Is this place a maze or what?

2246
00:15:57,637 --> 00:15:59,187
Please give me the bag.

2247
00:15:59,187 --> 00:16:01,147
I'll need to use something as a light...

2248
00:16:02,807 --> 00:16:03,687
Pino?

2249
00:16:04,357 --> 00:16:05,357
Pino!

2250
00:16:21,367 --> 00:16:22,537
This way.

2251
00:16:25,797 --> 00:16:27,047
That thing...

2252
00:16:27,047 --> 00:16:28,587
She knows where to go?

2253
00:16:31,757 --> 00:16:33,507
Information Bureau Agent Re-l,

2254
00:16:33,507 --> 00:16:35,427
where are you headed in such a hurry?

2255
00:16:35,757 --> 00:16:38,557
It seems your Entourage is not with you.

2256
00:16:38,557 --> 00:16:41,017
I'm going to inspect a crime scene
 in the immigrant residential sectors.

2257
00:16:42,187 --> 00:16:45,557
My Entourage is following me fifteen minutes behind.

2258
00:16:46,227 --> 00:16:47,897
Pardon me then.

2259
00:16:47,897 --> 00:16:49,737
Please be careful.

2260
00:16:58,537 --> 00:17:01,037
<i>So autoreivs infected by the cogito virus</i>

2261
00:17:01,037 --> 00:17:04,417
<i>were all trying to flee in the same direction.</i>

2262
00:17:06,997 --> 00:17:09,087
I guess none of this matters now.

2263
00:17:25,937 --> 00:17:27,807
It's a dead end.

2264
00:17:33,067 --> 00:17:34,107
Hey!

2265
00:17:44,577 --> 00:17:46,667
Her instincts are too sharp.

2266
00:17:46,667 --> 00:17:49,167
I wonder who she gets it from.

2267
00:17:49,457 --> 00:17:53,967
All citizens are based on synchronized information.

2268
00:17:54,257 --> 00:17:57,587
Localized approximations are insignificant.

2269
00:17:57,587 --> 00:18:01,637
I knew we shouldn't have assigned her to the Information Bureau.

2270
00:18:01,637 --> 00:18:04,227
No, it was an appropriate decision

2271
00:18:04,227 --> 00:18:06,187
from an educational perspective as well.

2272
00:18:06,897 --> 00:18:11,107
As proof, she possessed the highest sensitivity at the citizen level.

2273
00:18:11,647 --> 00:18:13,527
The results are excellent.

2274
00:18:13,527 --> 00:18:17,697
However, the resulting ability to
 take action is the cause behind it all.

2275
00:18:17,697 --> 00:18:19,237
Cause?

2276
00:18:19,237 --> 00:18:20,737
What about the Security Bureau?

2277
00:18:21,027 --> 00:18:22,657
There is no need for concern.

2278
00:18:22,657 --> 00:18:24,657
We made it quite clear to him.

2279
00:18:24,657 --> 00:18:25,907
In any case,

2280
00:18:25,907 --> 00:18:28,877
it cannot be denied that Romdeau's stability is weakening.

2281
00:18:28,877 --> 00:18:31,917
We must take rapid measures

2282
00:18:31,917 --> 00:18:33,457
to resolve the situation.

2283
00:18:33,457 --> 00:18:34,587
If we do not-

2284
00:18:34,587 --> 00:18:37,217
Our raison d'Ãªtre will be destroyed.

2285
00:18:37,217 --> 00:18:40,087
That is our sole source of anxiety.

2286
00:18:50,267 --> 00:18:52,227
You're here, aren't you, Vincent?

2287
00:18:54,187 --> 00:18:55,817
I'm here alone.

2288
00:18:58,647 --> 00:19:00,567
I don't have anything on me now.

2289
00:19:04,197 --> 00:19:05,077
Wait!

2290
00:19:11,327 --> 00:19:12,997
Hello.

2291
00:19:19,427 --> 00:19:21,087
Come out, Vincent!

2292
00:19:24,757 --> 00:19:26,427
Inspector Re-l,

2293
00:19:27,597 --> 00:19:28,597
I...

2294
00:19:32,937 --> 00:19:34,357
Vincent Law,

2295
00:19:34,937 --> 00:19:37,487
why are you wanted by the Security Bureau?!

2296
00:19:38,027 --> 00:19:39,277
Inspector...

2297
00:19:39,857 --> 00:19:41,527
What did you see in my bathroom?!

2298
00:19:41,527 --> 00:19:42,867
Answer me!

2299
00:19:42,867 --> 00:19:44,617
Bathroom?

2300
00:19:44,617 --> 00:19:46,737
How do you explain this?

2301
00:19:48,617 --> 00:19:49,787
Why...

2302
00:19:49,787 --> 00:19:50,617
do you have that?

2303
00:19:52,877 --> 00:19:54,377
You know already, don't you?

2304
00:19:57,707 --> 00:19:59,007
That...

2305
00:19:59,007 --> 00:20:00,377
monster...

2306
00:20:01,127 --> 00:20:02,047
What did you see?!

2307
00:20:02,047 --> 00:20:03,587
Wh-What did I see?

2308
00:20:03,587 --> 00:20:05,547
I was attacked suddenly at the mall!

2309
00:20:05,547 --> 00:20:08,017
Then the Security Bureau came after me!

2310
00:20:09,637 --> 00:20:10,767
Inspector,

2311
00:20:10,767 --> 00:20:12,517
I didn't do anything.

2312
00:20:12,517 --> 00:20:14,437
But why?

2313
00:20:14,437 --> 00:20:16,477
You saw the monster?

2314
00:20:16,477 --> 00:20:17,567
You also saw...

2315
00:20:18,147 --> 00:20:19,487
PROXY?

2316
00:20:20,897 --> 00:20:22,067
PROXY?

2317
00:20:29,537 --> 00:20:30,947
Vincent Law,

2318
00:20:30,947 --> 00:20:31,827
don't move!

2319
00:20:32,367 --> 00:20:34,497
Do exactly as we say.

2320
00:20:35,997 --> 00:20:37,127
So, the Security Bureau.

2321
00:20:39,757 --> 00:20:40,877
Re-l Mayer!

2322
00:20:40,877 --> 00:20:42,047
Vincent, it's not what you think!

2323
00:20:42,047 --> 00:20:43,127
What isn't?!

2324
00:21:03,817 --> 00:21:04,857
Outside!

2325
00:21:05,947 --> 00:21:06,867
Crap!

2326
00:21:21,127 --> 00:21:22,507
Vince!

2327
00:21:27,507 --> 00:21:28,887
Iggy, Vincent's-!

2328
00:21:28,887 --> 00:21:30,507
You silly girl!

2329
00:21:32,597 --> 00:21:34,097
Vincent!

2330
00:21:40,017 --> 00:21:41,687
<i>I've always...</i>

2331
00:21:42,277 --> 00:21:44,317
<i>tried to become a model citizen,</i>

2332
00:21:44,317 --> 00:21:45,987
<i>suppressing who I am...</i>

2333
00:21:45,987 --> 00:21:47,407
<i>putting up a front...</i>

2334
00:21:47,407 --> 00:21:49,447
<i>I've been trying desperately...</i>

2335
00:21:50,027 --> 00:21:51,027
<i>all the time...</i>

2336
00:21:51,527 --> 00:21:52,577
<i>no matter where I am.</i>

2337
00:21:53,077 --> 00:21:54,407
Vincent!

2338
00:21:54,907 --> 00:21:57,617
<i>And the end result of it all... is this?</i>

2339
00:21:58,287 --> 00:22:00,667
<i>I am a failure, that's what.</i>

2340
00:22:17,057 --> 00:22:18,227
Vincent...

2341
00:22:19,807 --> 00:22:20,727
Listen!

2342
00:22:20,727 --> 00:22:22,267
I'll talk to my grandfather!

2343
00:22:22,267 --> 00:22:24,067
I won't let the Security Bureau lay a finger on you either!

2344
00:22:26,027 --> 00:22:29,357
<i>Never doubting the system...</i>

2345
00:22:29,357 --> 00:22:30,567
<i>and following all the rules...</i>

2346
00:22:31,317 --> 00:22:34,697
<i>Those are the prerequisites for becoming a model citizen.</i>

2347
00:22:35,487 --> 00:22:36,697
Don't go!

2348
00:22:37,287 --> 00:22:38,327
<i>I...</i>

2349
00:22:38,907 --> 00:22:40,957
<i>don't think I can ever become a model citizen.</i>

2350
00:22:45,877 --> 00:22:46,957
<i>Not even at the very end.</i>

2351
00:22:53,467 --> 00:22:54,927
Why are you closing the plugvent?

2352
00:22:54,927 --> 00:22:56,597
Capture and arrest him!

2353
00:22:56,597 --> 00:22:58,427
Further exposure

2354
00:22:58,427 --> 00:23:00,887
will endanger the entire city.

2355
00:23:08,937 --> 00:23:09,897
Vincent!

2356
00:23:22,997 --> 00:23:24,207
<i>He...</i>

2357
00:23:31,427 --> 00:23:32,587
<i>It's over...</i>

2358
00:23:33,507 --> 00:23:34,927
<i>Everything...</i>

2359
00:23:37,217 --> 00:23:38,347
<i>is over.</i>

